      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this entirely handcrafted? I would expect that this should be a solved problem, and such regexps already exist or there are libraries that do this. Here is also a report from Gemini about the matter: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1l2gWgtqPWOvFPz4edLcV7Qb-PSetOFK0jecMiiXXykw/edit?usp\u003dsharing\u0026resourcekey\u003d0-l-Pve1JSKP5oN1-_YI-vYQ\n\nI have fine with just an \"Ack.\" response, but maybe add a comment about whether this expression was handcrafted from scratch or inspired by some existing library.",
